@startuml 记忆三层架构图
title 心屿记忆系统三层架构图

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

actor Agent

component "短期记忆\nPostgreSQL 最近40轮原文" as ShortMem
component "长期记忆\nPolarDB向量引擎 TopK检索" as LongMem
component "用户画像\nPolarDB Profile 全量注入" as Profile
component "MCP工具层" as MCP
component "Prompt组装" as Prompt

Agent --> MCP : 并行发起三次查询
MCP --> ShortMem
MCP --> LongMem
MCP --> Profile
ShortMem --> Prompt : 原文直接注入
LongMem --> Prompt : TopK按相关性注入
Profile --> Prompt : 全量注入

note right of Prompt
  三层各自独立注入
  某一层为空不阻塞其他两层
  这是空召回天然被容忍的架构基础
end note

@enduml
